<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hutchinson raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hutchinson raised to buy.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>John G. Kinnard &amp; Co analyst Clint Morrison said he raised his rating on Hutchinson Technology Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company closed Tuesday at 24.</p>
<p>-- No further information was immediately available.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
